,6243,10979,5159,10871],[5183,10899,6808,11141,8432,11274,8831,11274,8831,11475,7711,11427,5905,11221,5183,11100]],"text":["vnd wunschen deß vnflats, gebracht,","vnd gezogen, Wÿters aber","habe der böse mit ihra nit geredt,","ihra auch nüt geben, noch beuolchen,","Sÿ habe sich im̄e auch nüt ergeben","auch Niemandt nüt verderbt.","Dise dreÿ verdechtigen vnholden","Sindt in die wÿber-Cam̄eren","im Schallenhus erkendt","daß Sÿ daselbst söllindt ÿngespert","enthalten werden, biß man ge¬","spüren mag Ob der Schaden deß","fallenden vÿchs zů Limpach vf¬","hören, oder vngeacht ihrer absens","continuieren werde, damit","demnach wÿters nach beschaffen¬","heit, wider Sie möge procediert","werden.","Stephan Häni","vssem Adelboden.","Vf heüt den 25ten Augusti 1652","ist Stephan Häni vßem Adelboden","vngefahr von 25. järigen alter, So vor","etwas wenig zÿth gefencklich von","Interlacken alhar gefhüert, durch","mgHrn. Hrn. Samuel Lerber, E. gn.","Mitraht, vnd Jr. Großweÿbel vonn","Wattenwÿl, ernstwörtig in der","Kefi v̈er nachuolgende verdechtige","puncten examiniert worden.","Erstlich worumb er sich zů der von","aller weldt verachteten Stell eines","Waßenmeisters begeben? Hatt","er geantwurtet daß Soliches","theils vß Armut Schlechten vermögen","vnd Schlechter hilff süynnem wie wohl","habhafften fründen, So imme nur nit","beherbrigen wellen, vnd dan auch darumb","beschechen, daß vor vngefahr anderthalben","jahren Er Hanß Pordtners, So auch deß","verschmechten wesens gewsen, fr. geehlichet","darmit er gedacht sich erlich durchzebringen,","maßen dan Er alle zÿth gnůg zethůn gehabt","vnd von villfaltiger deß tags, vßgestandner","arbeit wegen am Abent hungerig vnnd","durstig zů Hus gangen, daß Es dan","etwas zwo mas wÿn gekostet, deßen","man im̄e biß vf 10. oder mehr dings","geben.","Gefragt Ob Er keine diebstäl begangen?","Antwort Nein gar nit, nit minder","aber Seÿe es den daß er bÿ 14 tagen","einen blinden Man̄ mit sÿner lÿrer fr.","ÿnzogen, vnd zum zÿthen den Mann ghulfen","fhüeren.","Gefragt, Ob er deß vor einen Nun bald","verfloßnen jahr in der fischetzen zů Inter¬","lacken funden thodten Cörpers nit Schuldig?","geantwortet Nein, Dan in der nacht","do derselbe habe söllen gemürdt worden","sÿn, Seÿen er, sÿn Můter, vnd sÿn fr. bÿsahmen","in sÿnem hus g'sin, vnd habindt mit einanderen","gesen truncken, vnd Seÿe darzů bÿ dem¬","selben das gelt noch gefunden worden.","Antreffendt dan das geklagte vnder","im̄e vnd sÿnen gespanen excerzierte","Strecken, Habe er Sölches Hanß Schmocker","sonst, Glaßer bůb gn̄t. von St. Beaten¬","berg, vf sÿn begehren gezeigt, damit er","So diser sach sich auch annem̄e sich imfahl","der noth wüße bruchen zelaßen.","Endtlich dan habe zwar Er deß Küeffer","Guliß Tochter, vnd Stephan Wenger","v̈bernacht, aber gezeigtermaßen mit ira","nüt zethůn gehabt, wol aber habe Sÿ"],"region":["paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph","paragraph"]}
